y like at some restaurants. I had the shrimp egg foo young and the BF tried the Kung Pao chicken. Both were YUM!! I tried the veggie soup and enjoyed it over hot rice. Give it a shot!"},{"business_id":"mXsfheczyGsMPsRSO_DGBw","review_id":"PGetpUfJqPthBPP3wdbfuQ","date":"2017-07-15T00:30:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9001278877258301,"text_excerpt":"Best shrimp toast of my life! Divey walk up window, but pleasant employees and decent parking. Crazy good prices. Saw a variety of food other people had ordered and it all looked delicious."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
